PRO FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION

The General Partner of the proposed Limited Partnership for wholesale distribution of clinical diagnostic ELISA assays and reagents resolves as follows:

RESOLVED that the General Partner subscribes to the initial capital contribution of the Limited Partnership in the amount of CAD 10,000, adopts the registered office at [Insert full address in Alberta], and appoints [Authorized Representative Name] as the authorized signatory to execute documents on behalf of the General Partner and the Partnership;

FURTHER RESOLVED that the General Partner authorizes the filing of the Application for Registration of a Limited Partnership with the Alberta Corporate Registry, the preparation and execution of the Limited Partnership Agreement, and all related matters of corporate governance and officer appointments in accordance with the Partnership Act (Alberta);

FURTHER RESOLVED that this resolution is passed by unanimous consent of the General Partner on [Date].
